{"id":5900,"date":"2021-08-16T14:12:28","date_gmt":"2021-08-16T14:12:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?p=5900"},"modified":"2021-08-16T14:12:28","modified_gmt":"2021-08-16T14:12:28","slug":"5-reasons-why-you-should-never-hire-an-inexperienced-dj","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/atlanta-dj\/5-reasons-why-you-should-never-hire-an-inexperienced-dj\/","title":{"rendered":"5 Reasons Why You Should Never Hire an Inexperienced DJ"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-medium wp-image-5901 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/5-Reasons-Why-You-Should-Never-Hire-an-Inexperienced-DJ-611a71d49bc3f-300x198.png\" alt=\" The Importance of Hiring an Experienced DJ\" width=\"300\" height=\"198\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/5-Reasons-Why-You-Should-Never-Hire-an-Inexperienced-DJ-611a71d49bc3f-300x198.png 300w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/5-Reasons-Why-You-Should-Never-Hire-an-Inexperienced-DJ-611a71d49bc3f-1024x676.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/5-Reasons-Why-You-Should-Never-Hire-an-Inexperienced-DJ-611a71d49bc3f-768x507.png 768w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/5-Reasons-Why-You-Should-Never-Hire-an-Inexperienced-DJ-611a71d49bc3f.png 1048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/>So, you\u2019re looking for a <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DJ<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to entertain guests at your office party or best friend\u2019s wedding. Maybe you\u2019ve found a few <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DJs<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on Facebook or Yelp and decided to check them out at a local event. Turns out nobody\u2019s dancing, the playlist is annoying, and the equipment fails in between the event.\u00a0 Are you willing to take the risk of hiring average or inexperienced DJs for your event?<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No, you\u2019re not, which is why you need to hire a <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">professional DJ entertainment service<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> that brings in experience and credibility and the proper equipment and diverse playlists. To ensure your event doesn\u2019t suck, read on to learn the <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">5 reasons why you should never hire an inexperienced DJ<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h1><b>5 Reasons Not to Hire an Inexperienced DJ for Your Event<\/b><\/h1>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\n<h2><b>Inexperienced DJs Play Too Full-On, Often Too Early<\/b><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most average DJs treat every event like a rave. Weddings, Bar &amp; Bat Mitzvahs, and corporate parties are all different events in terms of d\u00e9cor, theme, and guests. It takes time for the guests to settle in. Unfortunately, inexperienced DJs smash out the number-one EDM track too early, expecting people to miraculously head to the dance floor. This deluded tactic often fails, and by the time the guests are ready, the DJ runs out of choices quickly.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\n<h2><b>A Low Range of Song Choices<\/b><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Average professional DJs often stick to deep house, hip hop, and trance, which is great for club events, but not so much for more sophisticated, mainstream events. Therefore, they end playing dance remixes from the top 10 songs in the last two years hoping they will suffice. Some even fail to consider the age groups at events. At every given event, you can find guests from 10-60 years old on average, which means that you potentially have 5 decades of music to choose from.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\n<h2><b>Little or No Mike Experience<\/b><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Experienced professional DJs regularly host events or at the very least, announce proceedings. The last thing event managers need is a DJ with stage fright who just stares moodily at guests and mumbles important announcements.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\n<h2><b>Low-Grade Equipment and Backup<\/b><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can determine a DJ\u2019s abilities or experience by their equipment. Inexperienced DJs generally have limited equipment, and the last thing you want is for them to show up with an iPhone and a small set of speakers. Secondly, average DJs usually rent equipment that can potentially malfunction during events. More importantly, they don\u2019t have a backup system to make sure they successfully close the event.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\n<h2><b>Inexperienced DJs Might Not Be In Business at the Time of Your Event<\/b><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Many low-priced and inexperienced DJs don\u2019t have enough capital to support and sustain their services. Therefore, there\u2019s a chance that they might close shop within a few months. The last thing you want to deal with is cancellation just before your event.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h1><b>Hire the Best DJ Entertainment Service in Town<\/b><\/h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unless you\u2019re throwing a small cocktail party in your backyard, you need a <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">professional DJ<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to ensure your important event is successful. You can\u2019t afford to jeopardize a wedding or corporate event by hiring an <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">inexperienced DJ<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With 15 years of experience in event entertainment and management, <\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Jammin\u2019DJs<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> can enliven any event with quality DJ entertainment. Our renowned DJs have the latest equipment and an eclectic playlist to entertain any crowd.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">So, if you\u2019re in Denver, Atlanta, Detroit, and surrounding areas, feel free to contact our team anytime!<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>So, you\u2019re looking for a DJ to entertain guests at your office party or best friend\u2019s wedding. Maybe you\u2019ve found a few DJs on Facebook or Yelp and decided to check them out at a local event. Turns out nobody\u2019s dancing, the playlist is annoying, and the equipment fails in between the event.\u00a0 Are you&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5901,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[7,8,15,17,19,26],"tags":[43,46,47,48,49,51,58,104,177],"class_list":["post-5900","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-atlanta-dj","category-bar-mitzvah","category-dj-service","category-event-dj","category-mitzvah","category-wedding-djs","tag-affordable-dj-service","tag-atlanta-dj","tag-atlanta-dj-music","tag-atlanta-dj-service","tag-atlanta-entertainment","tag-atlanta-metro","tag-award-winning-dj-service","tag-dj-service","tag-wedding-dj"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>5 Reasons Why You Should Never Hire an Inexperienced DJ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Many DIY event planne